                                                "sense_id": "4f97fa62-fe61-3079-b8ff-640fe133d48c",
                                                "text": "Finally, instead of returning to Chile’s traditional proportional representation system, the law adopted the “binomial” system, which gave strong incentives to the parties to form broad coalitions."
                                            }
